This repo is **react-tooltip-native**: native-first tooltip and popover for React (Popover API + CSS Anchor Positioning, minimal JS fallback with ResizeObserver + scroll parents). No portals in native path; no Floating UI; bundle ≤ 4KB gzip; no feature drift beyond MVP.

**Rules:** Write tests for each module. Run `npm run test:all` before marking done. Change one area at a time and stop for commit.

**Single source of truth:** [docs/DEV-ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/DEV-ARCHITECTURE.md) — goals, strategy resolution, module structure (core, strategy, positioning, hooks, components), native/fallback adapters, flicker mitigation, behavior parity, performance model, test matrix, packaging. Library-specific: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [docs/PRD.md](../../docs/PRD.md), [docs/API_SPECS.md](../../docs/API_SPECS.md). Read these before implementing or reviewing. Follow the implementation order when adding features.
